{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implementation detail for this story (exact test edit list; the description carries the decisions). Line numbers are on origin/main 2e81cb9767c1.\n\nTests: `tests/unit/test_ci_workflow_parity.py:1848,1915` drop `\"e2e-deps\"` (the test-corpus epic owns every other assertion in that file); `tests/interfaces/contracts/test_workflow_error_codes_dbca.py:118-130` delete test; `tests/unit/test_execution_mode.py:144-166` delete 3 tests; `tests/unit/test_path_injection_guards.py:11,126-135` delete test and docstring; `tests/unit/workflow/test_contracts.py:17,77-111,263-277` delete import and 4 tests; `tests/unit/workflow/test_validation_depth.py:4,212-226` delete test and docstring; `tests/scripts/test_llm_seam_clean_heldout.py:8,36,53` drop entry and change \"19\" to \"18\"; `tests/unit/metrics/test_scc_module_size_reconciliation_heldout.py:98-99` drop 2 paths; `tests/unit/test_check_criteria_vocabulary.py:169` drop case; `tests/interfaces/contracts/test_help_overview_coverage.py:121,211-216` rename fixture dir to `vendor_assets`; comment-only: `tests/unit/test_prompt_library_writes.py:2,258`, `tests/unit/test_prompt_model_module_seam.py:26`; `tests/unit/test_config_resolver_seam.py:64` drop entry.\n\nHelper bodies to inline (from `src/rebar/llm/workflow/prompt_authoring.py`):\n```python\n# :50\n_SLUG = re.compile(r\"^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9-]*$\")\n# :65-66\ndef _valid_id(prompt_id: str) -> bool:\n    return bool(prompt_id) and bool(_SLUG.match(prompt_id))\n# :228-239 (docstring elided)\ndef _atomic_write(path: Path, text: str) -> None:\n    path.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    atomic_write(path, text, encoding=\"utf-8\", permissions=0o600)   # rebar._store.fsutil.atomic_write (:32)\n```\nSole surviving importer: `src/rebar/llm/prompting/prompt_library.py:185` (`_validate_id`) and `:254` (`_write`). After inlining, `prompting/` on origin/main holds `__init__.py, prompt_library.py, prompt_model.py, prompts.py, prompts_frontmatter.py` (295 to roughly 325 LOC for prompt_library).\n\nOnly `REBAR_PREVIEW_TIMEOUT` is a real env var: read at `src/rebar/_config_resolvers.py:407-418` (`resolve_preview_timeout`), re-exported `_config_sources.py:62`, `config.py:82`, pinned in `tests/unit/test_config_resolver_seam.py:64`, registered at `docs/env-vars.md:144`, baseline key `.github/mechanism-baseline.json:594`. `REBAR_MODDLE` is a JS `window` global (`editor.py:397`); `REBAR_MODDLE_DESCRIPTOR` is a Python dict (`bpmn.py:63`) exported in `workflow/__init__.py:31,71`. Regenerate with `python scripts/gen_env_registry.py` (check: `--check`, run by `make lint` at `Makefile:297` and `.github/actions/docs-gates/action.yml:42`)."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788805167410536559,"uuid":"2d3ac625-19a6-43c3-a2b3-f301be7caf63"}